1
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,390
♪Don't stay trapped inside your room♪

2
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,790
♪Outside the window,
the rain has cleared♪

3
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:11,070
♪Set reality aside♪

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,390
♪Follow your heart♪

5
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,750
♪What you've been longing
for is right ahead♪

6
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,230
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

7
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:18,110
♪Just be a little braver♪

8
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,870
♪Come closer, come closer♪

9
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:23,950
♪There's a little spark
shining in your eyes♪

10
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,070
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

11
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:29,790
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

12
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:33,820
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=
(Bonus Edition)

13
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,660
(Couples House)

14
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,320
You and Fang

15
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,880
are actually like two little flames.

16
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,840
You're both pretty calm,

17
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,960
but together,
things get a little intense.

18
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,040
Yeah, indeed a little intense.

19
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,560
A bit too lovey-dovey.

20
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,160
No, it's nice.

21
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,440
It's like two glasses of water

22
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,760
blending into one.

23
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,680
It feels like
you two are moving pretty fast.

24
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:10,360
Are we?

25
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,280
I feel like
you two just clicked right away.

26
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,200
How should I put it?

27
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,320
Actually...

28
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,440
Between the two of us,

29
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,360
Si

30
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,640
is the braver one.

31
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,120
I feel like

32
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,680
she's really strong inside.

33
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:26,040
She's especially...

34
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:26,800
Really brave.

35
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,840
There's such a powerful person

36
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,720
inside her.

37
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,320
(Full of energy)
Yeah.

38
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,400
Yeah, she's amazing.

39
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,200
Let's go.

40
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,440
What were you doing in your room today?

41
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,640
I was dancing

42
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,440
in my room.

43
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,280
Really?

44
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,040
No.

45
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,240
(Teasing)

46
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:42,840
I actually believed you.

47
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,840
I was just having fun by myself.

48
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,400
What kind of fun?

49
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,320
At breakfast, I started swaying

50
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,440
to the music while I ate.

51
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,560
Why?

52
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,800
I was in a really good mood today.

53
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,800
Just looking

54
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:56,360
at the ocean,

55
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,280
having breakfast,

56
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,960
and listening to music.

57
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:01,600
I was just missing someone beside me.

58
00:02:02,150 --> 00:02:03,010
Oh my gosh.

59
00:02:03,010 --> 00:02:04,700
(Acting cute)

60
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:05,560
(Sneaks a glance)

61
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,200
You're pretty hyper today.

62
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,680
Why?

63
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,240
Because you're happy.

64
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,120
Why?

65
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,640
I'm just full of energy today.

66
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,440
That's great.

67
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,440
I'm a little...

68
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,440
A little what?

69
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,720
Don't start.

70
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,960
Save that for later.

71
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,360
You'll use up all your energy.

72
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,360
Okay.

73
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,280
I'll save some.

74
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,200
Save some energy.

75
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,640
We still have dinner tonight.

76
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,640
(Presses)
Stop.

77
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,400
You...

78
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,280
What?

79
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,720
You said you'd control yourself.

80
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,600
Okay.

81
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,840
Why isn't Cui Yihang joining in?

82
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,120
He's sleepy.

83
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,200
He's probably sleeping.

84
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:37,880
What's wrong?

85
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,720
I asked if you were sleepy.

86
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,720
I just couldn't hear clearly
from up front.

87
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:41,840
Then I'll speak louder.

88
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,360
I think...

89
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,360
Don't.

90
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,000
Stop.

91
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,480
It's fine.

92
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,120
I got to shower yesterday.

93
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,480
You did?

94
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,760
I had a proper shower.

95
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,520
Yeah.

96
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,120
It doesn't hurt anymore?

97
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:53,480
It's completely healed.

98
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:55,240
No running around
like you did yesterday.

99
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:57,000
(Concerned)
Got it.

100
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,720
Yes, "sir".

101
00:02:58,740 --> 00:02:59,780
(Teasing)

102
00:03:05,130 --> 00:03:05,960
I need someone rational

103
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,320
to keep my impulses

104
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,960
in check.

105
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,600
We'll see if I can hold you back.

106
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,800
I couldn't yesterday, anyway.

107
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,960
You only stopped because you got hurt.

108
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:19,380
(Eye contact)

109
00:03:19,380 --> 00:03:20,840
So did I stop you?

110
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,640
I got hurt,

111
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,720
then you stopped me.

112
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,800
Otherwise, I could've kept running.

113
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,560
Fine.

114
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,040
I should've let you run.

115
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,040
I won't.

116
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,760
Little kid.

117
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:32,720
Little kid.

118
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,200
We're here.

119
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:39,640
Hello.

120
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,680
Take your buckets

121
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,560
and go feed the elephants.

122
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:42,880
(Professional supervision. Do not
approach wild animals on your own.)

123
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:43,920
It's huge.

124
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:44,760
So big.

125
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,440
We can give it a whole bunch.

126
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,680
Hello.

127
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,560
Hello, Mr. Elephant.

128
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,080
Here.

129
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:56,960
Can we go further in?

130
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:57,520
Let's go up front.

131
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:57,840
Yeah.

132
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,200
Okay.

133
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,600
We're heading up front.

134
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,240
Bye-bye.

135
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:01,800
Let's go.

136
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,720
You guys feed this one.

137
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:03,280
Let's go further in.

138
00:04:03,940 --> 00:04:05,140
(Wants some)

139
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,160
Let's give you another cucumber.

140
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,560
Give it a cucumber.

141
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:10,740
(Drops it)

142
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:11,680
(Pointing)
It doesn't like it.

143
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,680
- It doesn't like it.
- It likes this.

144
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,160
It wants everything.

145
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:18,800
Here, eat.

146
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,280
You...

147
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,840
You're...

148
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,600
You're not very nice.

149
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:29,580
(Hello)

150
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:35,920
Let me pet you.

151
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,440
They're a family.

152
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,280
Okay.

153
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,080
They're a family.

154
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:41,720
A whole family.

155
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,560
You must be the dad.

156
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,840
Here, have another one.

157
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:46,840
That's the mom.

158
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,160
That's the mom?

159
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:49,760
That's the mom?

160
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:50,720
That's the son.

161
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,160
That's the son?

162
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:51,440
Yeah.

163
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,880
Wow, it's so tiny.

164
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:53,320
Yeah.

165
00:04:55,370 --> 00:04:55,820
Wow!

166
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,600
It can wave goodbye.

167
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,720
Bye-bye.

168
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,320
Look, they're flapping their ears.

169
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:03,960
Bye-bye.

170
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,080
You've already snuck so much food,

171
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,080
and you still want more?

172
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,800
You're still chewing
and you're asking for more.

173
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:13,320
Let's find a family.

174
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:15,120
(Gets sprayed with snot)
I barely fed the mom

175
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,400
and the two calves on the right.

176
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,880
It sprayed you?

177
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,680
It sprayed me.

178
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,880
Let's pet it.

179
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,840
We're leaving. One last pet.

180
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,640
Bye-bye.

181
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,080
Let's go see "Flower Girl."

182
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:30,820
(Flower Girl)

183
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:31,860
(Gets sprayed with snot)

184
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,720
It's going to spray you.

185
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,240
Oh no.

186
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,840
Careful.

187
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,480
My clothes are ruined.

188
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,480
It's okay.

189
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,080
The two of us...

190
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,480
Its bangs

191
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,120
are kind of...

192
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,720
It has bangs.

193
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,680
It's actually pretty cute.

194
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,520
It has hair.

195
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,560
Here you go.

196
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,680
Buddy, you actually look

197
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,680
really cute.

198
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:50,960
Hello.

199
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,120
Give it some sugarcane.

200
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:57,760
Here's your sugarcane.

201
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,280
Hello.

202
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,920
Can I pet you?

203
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:03,560
Come here.

204
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,760
It's reaching into the bucket.

205
00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:05,680
(Self-Service)

206
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,600
It's helping itself.

207
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,840
Self-service.

208
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,000
I'll get it for you.

209
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,590
Oh my gosh.

210
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:11,960
It eats fast.

211
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,440
We have to share the love.

212
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,200
Share the love.

213
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,480
Bye-bye.

214
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,880
See you later.

215
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:20,960
It's saying, "Hurry up!"

216
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:21,760
Eat this.

217
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,680
You hold that one,
and I'll hold this one?

218
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,360
Can I hold you?

219
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,560
Hello.

220
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,760
(Kiss)
Okay.

221
00:06:35,050 --> 00:06:35,480
Oh my God.

222
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,240
Bye-bye.

223
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,920
Bye-bye.

224
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,400
It kissed me.

225
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,940
(Laughs)

226
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,660
(Fixes hair)
It snuck a kiss.

227
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,280
Okay.

228
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,720
Should I tuck your hair behind your ear?

229
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,400
You can leave it down too.

230
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,200
Loosen it a little.

231
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:01,920
Okay.

232
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,820
(Notices)

233
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,000
What?

234
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,080
There's something there.

235
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,880
A bug.

236
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,660
(Helps)

237
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,100
(Looks)

238
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,040
(Teasing)
Did my makeup come off?

239
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,600
There's a tiny black spot.

240
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,200
I'll take a photo for you.

241
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:19,760
Go on.

242
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:19,960
Okay.

243
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:20,680
Now.

244
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,800
Three,

245
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,360
two...

246
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,780
(I wanna stand tall!)

247
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:30,040
It's huge.

248
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,640
It's like

249
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,480
a giant puppy.

250
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,440
Let's see.

251
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,000
Give it a hug.

252
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,600
Looks good.

253
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:35,960
And this one.

254
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,000
I want a photo like this too.

255
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:40,880
Ready.

256
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:41,560
Three,

257
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,440
two,

258
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,040
one.

259
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,000
Got it.

260
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,160
There's another elephant over there.

261
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,760
My pants are covered in its snot.

262
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,520
Oh my gosh.

263
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:51,720
Wipe it off later.

264
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,280
It's getting impatient.

265
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,080
You can hug it.

266
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,040
Yeah.

267
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,160
Such a good baby.

268
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,000
I'll take a photo of you two.

269
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,880
One,

270
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:10,360
two,

271
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:10,880
three.

272
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,680
Looks pretty good.

273
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,440
Looks good.

274
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,640
Nice.

275
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:15,240
It's the composition.

276
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,120
I mainly wanted

277
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,120
to get the elephant up there in frame.

278
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:19,840
One,

279
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:20,320
two,

280
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:20,800
three.

281
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:23,720
Thanks.

282
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,120
Bye-bye.

283
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,000
Time to eat.

284
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,720
Bye-bye.

285
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:30,560
So for Fang,

286
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,920
was it love at first sight with Yu Yang?

287
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,240
I'd say so. I think it was.

288
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,160
She asked me,

289
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,760
and you're saying you "think" it was?

290
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,720
No, that's not what I meant.

291
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,080
I was just

292
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,800
giving a definite answer.

293
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:43,560
Okay.

294
00:08:44,160 --> 00:08:44,920
Then yes, it was.

295
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,800
It seemed like you two were together
from the start.

296
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,200
Yeah.

297
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,960
He was really introverted back then.

298
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:51,560
Very "I".

299
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:52,920
Exactly how he seemed

300
